work/
slprj/
*.slxc
*.autosave
*.asv
codegen/
# Simulink Test bookkeeping for the EPHEMERAL harnesses that the model_test
# Gherkin runner builds and discards (see simulink/tests/aeroecu.feature).
# Regenerated next to the model on every run; tracks nothing we author.
*_harnessInfo.xml
*.slx.original

# Third-party car assets (simulink/viz/assets/). The two Zenvo folders ARE
# tracked -- 14 MB and 18 MB of mesh + textures, and the visualisation is useless
# without them. One exception, and it covers two generated folders:
#
#    model_textures/ and model.fbm/ are GENERATED: the FBX loader and the FBX SDK
#    each extract the model's embedded textures next to it on first load.
#    Byte-identical to the textures already committed beside the model, and
#    rewritten on every load, so committing them would only make the tree dirty
#    every time a mesh is opened.
viz/assets/*/model_textures/
viz/assets/*/model.fbm/
